<title>UK: Rabobank sets 2.0 bln rand zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 2.0 bln rand zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank and Toronton Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN ZAR   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    23.JUL.27</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  3.10	PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    2.95	SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
